<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-11T22:53:08.679Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:53:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-linked rebels attacked the eastern border, killing at least 22 people, while Allied Democratic Forces militants struck Cantine in North Kivu, adding to instability. The military court sentenced 66 Congolese soldiers to death for cowardice after they fled an attack by FRN rebels. Ebola cases have surpassed 11,000, prompting Africa CDC condemnation and a surge in deaths, and the WHO warned that cholera has killed 1,800 people in the country. An L-410 aircraft crashed during an emergency landing, killing 17 people. Battle-related deaths totaled 1,158 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZG1waG1xOHJUdGpBcUdNUXNmSUJ6bUctdFFZMmw4OVhPUmdUTzdSMVJWOFJ1N1dLWDVVcVh6MDY5VlRmT2tZSFJIWFZrU1E2RmxtV1JRaDE0Q3dJcEVtMHUza3Z2d1Bla3FMcWZqeUgxRjBZQ1pEODhzUHVHZHA0aFBSZXdlWElQU1JxbVE3cEtYS01Nel9XbUNxbGwwYXVVQVlCUHA4YTIyS0RjVTVPMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5hWENNVUc2eUc4ajBIQlZ4aUF5RnF2TnJCVlFCY0RrNkhZbTBweGRlemxnbEY0ZTk0bl9CcnpFRTU2ZmdKSExyNzRMdnNnZlIzRjFoQ0dEMDV1YVlSV1HSAWNBVV95cUxQS1JVQ0YwOWdKbUs4QTlUWWFoSjZUbEhyRndCa1pvWnJPYW5KTHpoV0xqZnlwV3V6NkVnRHp4TzFJemFTcEpaYkxXNk9pVzFWaTZ0U2loXzBwMnFvYmNyamZzMmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBZVTFvYm1hNVUzaXN2QndFdjgzN0RQVGlsVVNBMzhCLUNhRUh3TkhPdGxBYmpSRDQ3NHVVVVdfVHUwT0oyanhRUXowb3h1bFBISlJwYWJhMi1EWGRzZVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTFBjOUpwSjZZNWN3NXd2d1pYR2UyakJaSWhpdDhGWExaY3FFd0VIa2NqRXBFRjlUdE5Nb2RFOHVTdUpwVFg3dFV2QW5JbWE4SWdDZ1lfOW5vSmlxTG1RNlpEUEtmVGF3d3kwUThB